{"id": "EUVD-2026-102349", "enisaUuid": "ba4527ca-f458-3ed8-bf3b-22e45eb95d39", "description": "Dolibarr before 23.0.4 contains a PHP object injection vulnerability in jsonOrUnserialize() in functions.lib.php, which calls unserialize() without class restrictions when json_decode() fails. Attackers able to write stored extrafields, export configurations or blocked log entries can plant serialized objects that trigger gadget chains for code execution or file manipulation.", "datePublished": "2026-10-15T18:57:17", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-15T19:47:43", "baseScore": 7.5, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:H/AT:P/PR:H/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/Dolibarr/dolibarr/pull/38530", "https://github.com/Dolibarr/dolibarr/commit/17658fcaefdaabe13685e566e5f12d5fbd4f4a5c", "https://github.com/Dolibarr/dolibarr", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/dolibarr-before-23.0.4-php-object-injection-via-jsonorunserialize"], "aliases": ["GHSA-52qw-6h47-qw3w", "CVE-2026-110874"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.51, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "932a094f-e248-372f-8e98-314a6d983516", "product": {"name": "dolibarr", "vendor": {"name": "Dolibarr"}}, "product_version": "0 <23.0.4"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "127377af-bd48-38d3-9fd6-792e69ced07f", "vendor": {"name": "Dolibarr"}}], "isExploited": false}